  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q30
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD architect m\u1ED9t h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng Inventory cho
    RPG nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o?"
  choices:
  - text: "L\u01B0u item trong array, UI loop qua array \u0111\u1EC3 hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Qu\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n, kh\xF4ng scale \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
  - text: "D\xF9ng List<Item> cho inventory. Item class c\xF3 name, icon, quantity.
      UI update khi list thay \u0111\u1ED5i."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Functional nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a t\xE1ch concern r\xF5 r\xE0ng."
  - text: "InventoryData l\xE0 ScriptableObject ho\u1EB7c serializable class ch\u1EE9a
      List<ItemStack>. ItemDefinition SO cho item config (name, icon, stackable,
      maxStack). InventorySystem x\u1EED l\xFD logic (Add, Remove, Move, Split...).
      UI d\xF9ng Observer pattern - InventoryUI subscribe OnInventoryChanged event.
      D\xF9ng Command pattern cho undo. Save b\u1EB1ng JSON serialize."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Design \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7: data, logic, UI t\xE1ch bi\u1EC7t,
      c\xF3 Command pattern."
  category: Architecture
